            "review_text": "Annie W\n2410 contributions\n0\nGreat deal\nJun 2018 • Friends\nLucky for us the World Cup Soccer is on and the deals are great. The deal we chose included 5 Heineken beers for free, so when we couldn’t drink them all they allowed us to take some home. The meals were really tasty and fresh and couldn’t fault the service and the cleanliness of the facilities including the toilets. It worked out approximately $15 Australian which is top value considering the beers.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 28, 2018",
