            "review_text": "Aleksandra_FI\nNummela, Finland10 contributions\n0\nBad experience\nFeb 2018 • Solo\nAlthough the staff was friendly the fried rice I had was the worst so far. It was supposed to be fried rice with seafood but it was fried rice with corn, peas and carrots (the kind you get frozen) and maybe 1 small shrimp and 1 tentacle cut into tiny peaces. Maybe it was due to the holidays I don’t know but I would suggest some other place.\nWritten February 20, 2018",
